    <briefdescription>
<para>This class provides an implementation of a range of indexed_accessor_iterators where the base is not indexable. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Ranges with bases that are offsetable should derive from indexed_accessor_range_base instead. Derived range classes are expected to implement the following static method:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ReferenceT dereference(const BaseT &amp;base, ptrdiff_t index)<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Dereference an iterator pointing to a parent base at the given index. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
